* Vinnie's I/O constants (from the 2299 listing expansion).
* NULL matches stdio.ah so a second EQU of the same value is legal.

TXLEN	EQU	$20
RXLEN	EQU	$20

NULL	EQU	0
CTRLC	EQU	3
CTRLD	EQU	4
BELL	EQU	7
LF	EQU	10
CR	EQU	13
CTRLQ	EQU	17
CTRLS	EQU	19
*ESC	EQU	31
SPACE	EQU	32
DEL	EQU	127

BACK	EQU	$8
VC	EQU	$F	Visible Cursor
IVC	EQU	$E	InVisible Cursor
ESC	EQU	$1B
